 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "The tallest building in the world,",
   "s": 0.296,
   "e": 1.765
  },
  {
   "text": "and a man measured it without touching it.",
   "s": 2.01,
   "e": 3.842
  },
  {
   "text": "It's around six hundred B. C.",
   "s": 4.462,
   "e": 6.709
  },
  {
   "text": "Thales, a Greek thinker from Miletus,",
   "s": 6.968,
   "e": 8.43
  },
  {
   "text": "travels to Egypt.",
   "s": 8.643,
   "e": 9.73
  },
  {
   "text": "In front of him stands the Great Pyramid,",
   "s": 10.3,
   "e": 12.287
  },
  {
   "text": "the tallest thing humans have ever built.",
   "s": 12.616,
   "e": 14.547
  },
  {
   "text": "But how tall is it,",
   "s": 15.094,
   "e": 15.976
  },
  {
   "text": "exactly?",
   "s": 16.135,
   "e": 16.765
  },
  {
   "text": "You can't climb it with a tape measure.",
   "s": 17.757,
   "e": 19.35
  },
  {
   "text": "You can't drop a rope from the top.",
   "s": 19.799,
   "e": 21.251
  },
  {
   "text": "You'd need a very long ladder, and a lot of courage.",
   "s": 21.643,
   "e": 24.127
  },
  {
   "text": "So,",
   "s": 24.599,
   "e": 24.983
  },
  {
   "text": "the story goes, he waits.",
   "s": 25.137,
   "e": 26.627
  },
  {
   "text": "He watches his own shadow shrink as the sun climbs higher.",
   "s": 27.205,
   "e": 30.078
  },
  {
   "text": "Then, at one moment,",
   "s": 31.06,
   "e": 32.045
  },
  {
   "text": "his shadow is exactly as long as he is tall.",
   "s": 32.303,
   "e": 34.667
  },
  {
   "text": "And here's the trick.",
   "s": 35.085,
   "e": 35.95
  },
  {
   "text": "If that's true for him, it's true for everything else, too.",
   "s": 36.505,
   "e": 39.544
  },
  {
   "text": "Even the pyramid.",
   "s": 39.882,
   "e": 40.711
  },
  {
   "text": "So right then, he measures the pyramid's shadow,",
   "s": 41.185,
   "e": 43.708
  },
  {
   "text": "from its center to the tip.",
   "s": 43.852,
   "e": 44.973
  },
  {
   "text": "That length is the pyramid's height.",
   "s": 45.41,
   "e": 47.019
  },
  {
   "text": "No ladder.",
   "s": 47.523,
   "e": 48.078
  },
  {
   "text": "No rope.",
   "s": 49.08,
   "e": 49.603
  },
  {
   "text": "Just one shadow, and one idea.",
   "s": 49.949,
   "e": 51.712
  },
  {
   "text": "Today, that same trick of comparing shadows and triangles still helps people measure trees,",
   "s": 52.221,
   "e": 57.113
  },
  {
   "text": "towers and mountains.",
   "s": 57.391,
   "e": 58.577
  },
  {
   "text": "Sometimes the answer isn't climbing higher.",
   "s": 59.09,
   "e": 61.18
  },
  {
   "text": "It's looking down.",
   "s": 61.617,
   "e": 62.374
  }
 ]
}